==============================

Phase 1 — Hybrid ELT

==============================

Data

DATA_FILE=data/orders_huge_mixed_quality.csv
SMALL_SAMPLE_FILE=data/orders_sample.csv

MongoDB

MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/
DB_NAME=bigdata_midterm
RAW_COLLECTION=orders_raw
VALID_COLLECTION=orders_validated
QUAR_COLLECTION=orders_quarantine

Pipeline

SMALL_FILE_THRESHOLD_MB=200
BATCH_SIZE=1000
SAMPLE_ROWS=100000

Spark

SPARK_MASTER=local[*]
SPARK_DRIVER_MEMORY=4g
SPARK_MAX_PARTITION_BYTES=128m

Change this path if required by the local machine.

SPARK_LOCAL_DIRS=D:/spark_tmp

==============================

Phase 2 — Final Requirements

==============================

Delta / Incremental Processing

DELTA_FILE=data/delta_orders.csv
VERSION_FIELD=version
RECORD_HASH_FIELD=record_hash

Phase 2 Scheduler

3600 seconds = 1 hour

PHASE2_JOB_INTERVAL_SECONDS=3600
PHASE2_REPORT_INTERVAL_SECONDS=3600

Set to true only when the background scheduler

should start automatically with the API.

START_PHASE2_SCHEDULER=false